{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meat Market is a dystopian simulation game featuring high levels of gore and dismemberment. You are vengeance incarnate. Hunt down your daughter\u2019s killers one by one, sell them to zombies in your old butcher shop, and upgrade your business with the fire of revenge. Process corpses in various ways and improve your life. The end of this carnage is in your hands; you choose when to show mercy to the killers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong><u>This game contains extreme gore, dismemberment, and dark themes.</u></strong> \u26a0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find and kill your enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/669203dc2d4a34540ab4e337d04d79b4.poster.avif?t=1773842816\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/669203dc2d4a34540ab4e337d04d79b4.webm?t=1773842816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/669203dc2d4a34540ab4e337d04d79b4.mp4?t=1773842816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tear them apart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/15042bdbbe4a154de0a32a6c52d68c8c.poster.avif?t=1773842816\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/15042bdbbe4a154de0a32a6c52d68c8c.webm?t=1773842816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/36096